// Written by patchbay from the API documentation. Regenerated on every attempt, do not edit.
// Source: https://developer.zendesk.com/api-reference/webhooks/event-types/ticket-events
// Source: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/issues/issues#create-an-issue
// Source: https://developer.zendesk.com/api-reference/ticketing/tickets/tickets

/** Example payload of the source event, as documented. */
